# Test: OSPFv3 Segment Routing disabled is inert (spec-ospf-ext-5 AC-20).
#
# VALIDATES: with SR disabled, the IPv6 SR origination pass originates no RFC 8362 SR Extended
# LSAs and keeps no self-LSA refs (so the stale flush MaxAge-purges any residue); the E-Router /
# E-Intra-Area-Prefix / E-Inter-Area-Prefix types are registered as self-managed for the flush.
# PREVENTS: an SR Extended LSA originated or left lingering when SR is off; base OSPFv3 unaffected.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf -run 'TestOSPFv3SRDisabledOriginatesNothing|TestOSPFv3ManagedSelfTypesIncludeSR' -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
